<main class="wrap">

  <section class="in-wrap" id="intakeSection">
    <div class="in-hero">
      <div class="in-orb" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="in-ring"><span style="transform:rotate(0deg) translateY(-64px) rotate(-0deg)">♈</span><span style="transform:rotate(30deg) translateY(-64px) rotate(-30deg)">♉</span><span style="transform:rotate(60deg) translateY(-64px) rotate(-60deg)">♊</span><span style="transform:rotate(90deg) translateY(-64px) rotate(-90deg)">♋</span><span style="transform:rotate(120deg) translateY(-64px) rotate(-120deg)">♌</span><span style="transform:rotate(150deg) translateY(-64px) rotate(-150deg)">♍</span><span style="transform:rotate(180deg) translateY(-64px) rotate(-180deg)">♎</span><span style="transform:rotate(210deg) translateY(-64px) rotate(-210deg)">♏</span><span style="transform:rotate(240deg) translateY(-64px) rotate(-240deg)">♐</span><span style="transform:rotate(270deg) translateY(-64px) rotate(-270deg)">♑</span><span style="transform:rotate(300deg) translateY(-64px) rotate(-300deg)">♒</span><span style="transform:rotate(330deg) translateY(-64px) rotate(-330deg)">♓</span></div>
        <div class="in-om">ॐ</div>
      </div>
      <div class="in-eyebrow">Jyotiṣa · Vedic Astrology</div>
      <h2>Your birth chart, <em>decoded</em> in seconds</h2>
      <p>Tell us when and where you were born. We map the sky at that exact moment — your signs, planets, life periods and more.</p>
      <div class="in-get">
        <div><span>◈</span>Birth chart<small>+ 20 divisional charts</small></div>
        <div><span>◷</span>Life timeline<small>120-year Dasha</small></div>
        <div><span>✦</span>Yogas &amp; strength<small>Planet power</small></div>
        <div><span>🎯</span>Time rectification<small>Unsure of your time?</small></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="in-saved" id="inSaved" hidden></div>

    <form class="in-card" id="birthForm" autocomplete="off">
      <div class="in-progress"><div class="in-progress-top"><b id="inStepLbl">Step 1 of 3</b><span id="inStepHint">Let's start with your name</span></div><div class="in-bar"><i id="inBarFill"></i></div></div>

      <div class="in-step" data-step="1">
        <div class="in-step-h"><span class="in-num">1</span><div><b>Who are you?</b><small>Used to label your chart</small></div></div>
        <div class="form-grid"><div class="field full">
          <label for="profileName">Your name</label>
          <input type="text" id="profileName" placeholder="e.g. Ananya Sharma" required>
        </div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="in-step" data-step="2">
        <div class="in-step-h"><span class="in-num">2</span><div><b>When were you born?</b><small>The more exact, the more accurate</small></div></div>
        <div class="form-grid">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="dobInput">Date of birth</label>
            <input type="date" id="dobInput" required>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="tobInput">Time of birth</label>
            <input type="time" id="tobInput" step="1" required>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="in-tip">💡 <span>Not sure of the exact time? Enter your best guess, then fine-tune it later with <b>Rectify</b>. Seconds are optional.</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="in-step" data-step="3">
        <div class="in-step-h"><span class="in-num">3</span><div><b>Where were you born?</b><small>Search your city — we fill in the rest</small></div></div>
        <div class="form-grid">
          <div class="field full location-wrap">
            <label for="placeInput">Place of birth</label>
            <input type="text" id="placeInput" placeholder="Start typing a city name…" required>
            <div class="location-results" id="locationResults"></div>
            <div class="location-status" id="locationStatus"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="tzInput">Timezone (UTC)</label>
            <select id="tzInput" required></select>
            <span class="field-hint" id="tzHint">Auto-filled from place; adjust if needed</span>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>Coordinates</label>
            <div class="coord-readout" id="coordReadout">— not yet selected —</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="error-banner" id="errorBanner"></div>

      <div class="submit-row">
        <button type="submit" class="btn-cast" id="castBtn">✨ Reveal my chart</button>
        <div class="in-micro">Takes a few seconds · You can edit anything later</div>
      </div>
    </form>
  </section>

